[2090] = "Clé CREATURE enregistrée existante : BEAST, DRAGONKIN, DEMON, ELEMENTAL, GIANT, UNDEAD, HUMANOID, CRITTER, MECHANICAL, OTHER, TOTEM, NONCOMBAT_PET ou GAS_CLUUD.",
-- 93af5992 English: Explicit finite clock snapshot; signed and fractional values remain valid.
